<title>INDIA: India's Asea Brown offers 1:3 bonus share.</title>
<headline>India's Asea Brown offers 1:3 bonus share.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical equipment maker Asea Brown Boveri (ABB) will issue one bonus share for every three held, an official at the Bombay Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said the firm set an interim dividend of three rupees for every 10 rupee face value share.</p>
<p>The decision was taken at a board meeting earlier in the day.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
